4
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:12,720
Our blind date was fake.

5
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,480
It was all set up.

6
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,620
They told me to get close to you

7
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:17,920
and investigate you.

8
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,560
So what did you find out?

9
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:25,120
Aren't you mad?

10
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:30,000
No, I'm not.

11
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,180
If it weren't for them,

12
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,930
I wouldn't have met you.

13
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,960
But I suspect they made a mistake.

14
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:45,680
They should be investigating Pei Ning.

15
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,160
I have one more thing to confess.

16
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,880
I stole your latest

17
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,540
big data analysis algorithm.

18
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,600
You gave them my algorithm.

19
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,880
If they are using my algorithm,

20
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:25,640
I can detect it here

21
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,680
and find their IP address.

22
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,360
I suspect it now.

23
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,520
This IP matches the one

24
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,980
from the big data analysis experiment post.

25
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,160
Pei Song.

26
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,760
Exactly.

27
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:49,800
So,

28
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:52,760
