81
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,280
Murderer.

82
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:10,720
Mom.

83
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,420
Give me back my son.

84
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,600
Give me back my son.

85
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,520
You are all murderers.

86
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,800
Give me back my son.

87
00:08:17,280 --> 00:08:18,840
Give me back my son.

88
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,080
Son,

89
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:23,680
