102
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,800
Okay.

103
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:56,960
Relax.

104
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:58,280
It's fine.

105
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:01,040
Everything will be okay.

106
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:06,280
Son.

107
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,490
In our past life,

108
