112
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,760
Until you found out

113
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,600
that it was all related to Pei Ning.

114
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:34,930
To get close to Pei Ning,

115
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,220
you divorced me

116
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:37,570
