122
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,840
Introduced by the elders.

123
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,300
Introduced by the elders.

124
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:50,720
Grandpa.

125
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:52,200
